{
    "word": "lippy",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f29cd11d-d238-3f7f-87c7-fff15af2c1d7",
                "word": "lippy",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b391fdec-9981-419e-83b3-ee8126a3d62a",
                        "entry_id": "f29cd11d-d238-3f7f-87c7-fff15af2c1d7",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "lippier"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3820a84d-91a3-4b6e-ae75-2777789239ff",
                        "entry_id": "f29cd11d-d238-3f7f-87c7-fff15af2c1d7",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "lippiest"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e83f0bff-b62c-3591-bc41-58660f8f6272",
                        "entry_id": "f29cd11d-d238-3f7f-87c7-fff15af2c1d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having prominent lips."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ea323a0-ddf1-4313-8a4b-2c1d6cafe9ae",
                                "sense_id": "e83f0bff-b62c-3591-bc41-58660f8f6272",
                                "text": "His eyes were large and prominent, his mouth wide and lippy, and as he bent over his books he emitted sundry low growls and grunts, plainly indicating that his temper was none of the sweetest."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4554ef52-6552-32ce-af90-eec8db0872dd",
                        "entry_id": "f29cd11d-d238-3f7f-87c7-fff15af2c1d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a tendency to talk back in a cheeky or impertinent manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c33b06d9-ab4c-4f35-b93f-7fa1c0290e27",
                                "sense_id": "4554ef52-6552-32ce-af90-eec8db0872dd",
                                "text": "Don't give me any lip! I don't like how lippy you've been acting lately! Clean your room."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "860b35de-3ee5-48e2-b2b1-bfef2e0d6140",
                                "sense_id": "4554ef52-6552-32ce-af90-eec8db0872dd",
                                "text": "No, it's [Tamil is] a happy, snappy, lippy, and loping lingo anyone can see just makes these guys happy to speak and hear."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f259f064-ab64-4d58-b4be-7b52e7b8b651",
                                "sense_id": "4554ef52-6552-32ce-af90-eec8db0872dd",
                                "text": "I hesitated another moment, then followed her with a vow that I would walk out the instant she got lippy. If she wanted to fire me, fine, I'd go, but I'd be damned if I'd let her lay any crap on me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fcb1f46-72c8-4dbb-8a9a-76b3020f751a",
                                "sense_id": "4554ef52-6552-32ce-af90-eec8db0872dd",
                                "text": "His silence conceded the point. Either she'd gotten lippier down the years, or he was getting rusty. Both, probably."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9b63de1-af5f-4d07-a94f-587e1d76921a",
                                "sense_id": "4554ef52-6552-32ce-af90-eec8db0872dd",
                                "text": "In clothes, language, and manner, he's hip-hop ghetto meets Italian mobster. He's the lippiest, most foul-mouthed, most confrontational kid I've ever met and also one of the funniest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49029455-8700-4d25-9bbd-c5ecaf0ebbfb",
                                "sense_id": "4554ef52-6552-32ce-af90-eec8db0872dd",
                                "text": "Wouldn't it just be my luck to come across the lippiest desk nurse in the whole of Miami?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69a084be-f0d6-4185-b430-f6bccaba7f00",
                        "source_entry_id": "f29cd11d-d238-3f7f-87c7-fff15af2c1d7",
                        "source_sense_description": "having prominent lips",
                        "target_lang_word": "lippu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lippu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab696c83-fbbb-372a-ae62-22b525743d67",
                                        "entry_id": "0b3342c1-7c5c-3865-bc66-03cb0b35f45a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a une grosse lèvre inférieure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a0fa8f7-07f2-3e92-b77d-0599d3cde77c",
                                        "entry_id": "0b3342c1-7c5c-3865-bc66-03cb0b35f45a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a de grosses lèvres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1a6c36-6af1-4da5-bb52-9d324d7d261c",
                                                "sense_id": "0a0fa8f7-07f2-3e92-b77d-0599d3cde77c",
                                                "text": "– Est-ce qu’elle est en bon état ? – s’enquit un personnage lippu, dont le visage portait une cicatrice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d59b4cb1-087c-4e3c-b153-8766134f8fcf",
                                                "sense_id": "0a0fa8f7-07f2-3e92-b77d-0599d3cde77c",
                                                "text": "Au portrait, qu'il nous brosse dès l’entrée et sans vergogne, de Pan qui eﬁfayait les nymphes avec ses cornes, bouche lippue, yeux bridés au regard aiguisé par la luxure, sans oublier (ce sont ses propres paroles) un ventre de femme enceinte ballant sur deux jambes velues et grêles, Yvonne croit voir le Curé tout nu, pousse un cri et s'enfuit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5223f79-1f20-44e1-9340-4cfb9f9f32fd",
                                                "sense_id": "0a0fa8f7-07f2-3e92-b77d-0599d3cde77c",
                                                "text": "Sur la table, il reconnut la bouteille de vin avec le bouchon de fantaisie représentant une tête d’homme vermeille et lippue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed40354c-c04f-4468-978d-ea75697ce075",
                                                "sense_id": "0a0fa8f7-07f2-3e92-b77d-0599d3cde77c",
                                                "text": "Dame Virginie, cuivrée et lippue, ses cheveux crépus dans un madras rouge, — ivre elle aussi, — épongeait du sang sur une tête blonde."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
